## Part 16 — Repeatable 14-Step Discovery Engine

```mermaid
graph TD
    Discover[1. Market Intelligence Discovery] --> Dedupe[2. Deduplication & Canonical ID]
    Dedupe --> Classify[3. Category & IP Classification]
    Classify --> Verify[4. Browser Runtime Verification]
    Verify --> QualityEval[5. Quality Score Evaluation /100]
    QualityEval --> RightsCheck[6. Legal & Licensing Rights Check]
    RightsCheck --> TechCheck[7. Technical Integration Check]
    TechCheck --> CompetitorCheck[8. Competitor Overlap Check]
    CompetitorCheck --> ScoreAcq[9. Acquisition Feasibility Score /100]
    ScoreAcq --> Outreach[10. Developer / Publisher Contact]
    Outreach --> License[11. License Negotiation]
    License --> Integrate[12. Next.js Sandbox Integration]
    Integrate --> QA[13. Performance & Mobile QA]
    QA --> Publish[14. Publish to PlayThorn & Monitor]
```

